# Landing page conventions

- One primary export per file in `components/sections/`
- Copy lives in `content/` modules, not inline in `app/page.tsx`
- Image paths use `IMAGE_PATHS` from `lib/constants/images.ts`
- Colors and spacing use CSS variables in `app/globals.css` (`text-brand`, `bg-brand`, etc.)
- Use `SectionContainer` for horizontal padding and max width
- Use `cn()` from `lib/utils.ts` for conditional classes
- Prefer semantic HTML (`header`, `main`, `section`, `footer`, heading order)
- No raw hex in components — use theme tokens
